        "info": "Demonstrates the sum node accumulating values per msg.topic, updating an existing topic's value, and resetting via msg.reset.\n\nClick the inject buttons from top to bottom and watch the debug sidebar: the total after \"Topic A = 5\" is 5, after \"Topic B = 10\" is 15, after \"Topic A = 7\" (which replaces the earlier 5) is 17, and after \"Reset\" it drops back to 0.",
